# Express
1. Create project folder (LAB5)
2. Create two folder (frontend , backend) in root(LAB5)
3. open terminal and reah to backend by 
    ```
        cd..
        cd LAB5
        cd Backend 
        ```
4. type `npm init -y`
5. install nodemon `npm i nodemon -D`
6. install express `npm i express`
7. update backend/package.json
    - change type `type:"module`
    - change script
    ```
    "scripts": {
    "start":"node app.js" , 
    "dev":"nodemon prg1.js"
  }
  ```
8. add `LAB5/backend/node_modules` to .gitignore
9. create `prh1.js` in Backend
10. write the sript below to start express server

    ```
    import express from 'express' 

const app = express();

app.get("/" , ( req, res) => {
    res.send("Hello Express") ; 
}) ;


// this line must be last line ✅
app.listen(4444 , () => console.log('prg1 i runnit at 4444')) ;

    ```

# Static import 
- in express we can add any static html pages 

- express supports middle ware , when we have to execute sum functions before server execution then we use middleware `app.use` always apply insert any middleware 